{"unit_id":"Fish-under-sea__dsh-our-free-model-fish#card-zh","repo":"Fish-under-sea/dsh-our-free-model-fish","commit":"9697fb2cb897020c7ada532edb1ecc7b9fa1b4fc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**Our Free Model（Fish fork）** 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的模型接入插件，客户端界面通过 DSH web 展示。它把免密免费模型、Kilo 免费模型及用户配置的第三方提供商汇入模型选择器，并把模型能力与当前出口的可用性用于目录和路由。用户可设置降级链，在候选模型之间自动切换；也可打开本机兼容网关，把模型提供给其它兼容客户端。插件附带模型设置与统计页面，并在桌面宿主提供 EAC 渠道。免费通道无需 API Key；聚合提供商需按所选服务配置凭据，且会将请求发送给相应模型服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:436","src/core/runtime.js:47","src/combos.js:1","src/forward.js:305","cordis.patch.yml:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Fish-under-sea__dsh-our-free-model-fish#card-en","repo":"Fish-under-sea/dsh-our-free-model-fish","commit":"9697fb2cb897020c7ada532edb1ecc7b9fa1b4fc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**Our Free Model (Fish fork)** adds anonymous, Kilo, and optional provider models to DeepSeek Harness. It builds the picker from model availability, supports fallback chains, and offers a local compatible gateway with settings and usage views. Free lanes need no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:436","src/core/runtime.js:47","src/combos.js:1","src/forward.js:305","cordis.patch.yml:1"]}
